## Drag Selection

What to test:

- Drag a rectangle across markers and bars; every item inside is selected.
- Confirm selected items adopt the configured selected style across line, bar, area and range series.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Drag Selection" name="drag-selection" type="generated" /%}

## Multiple Series Selection

What to test:

- Drag-select across several series and confirm items from each series are tracked independently.
- Save the current selection, change data or series, then restore and confirm selection persists.
- Confirm selection styling survives zoom and navigator interactions.

