## Error Bars

What to test:

- Click or drag to select datums and confirm error bars adopt the selected stroke.
- Hover a different datum and confirm highlight styling overrides selection without clearing it.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Error Bars" name="error-bars" type="generated" /%}

## Pie Selection

What to test:

- Click a sector and confirm it offsets outward.
- Click another sector and confirm only one sector is offset at a time.
- Click outside the sectors to clear selection.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Pie Selection" name="pie-selection" type="generated" /%}

## Org Chart

What to test:

- Collapse/expand operations do not change the selection state, and vice-versa.
- The "Get Selection" button logs the nodes that are selected, whether shown or hidden (collapsed).
- When something is selected
    - Selected cards have a slightly thicker stroke-width.
    - Unselected cards are dimmed.
- Mouse:
    - Clicking on Cards updates selection.
    - Clicking on Expander collapses/expands tree.
    - Dragging with containment "any" selects Cards that intersect with the drag-rect.
    - Dragging with containment "all" selects Cards that are contained within the drag-rect.
- Keyboard:
    - ArrowLeft: Navigate to sibling on the left.
    - ArrowRight: Navigate to sibling on the right.
    - ArrowUp: Navigate to parent node.
    - ArrowDown: Navigate to 1st child node.
    - Alt+ArrowUp: Collapse focused node.
    - Alt+ArrowDown: Expand focused node.
    - Space / Enter: Select focused node (deselect everything else).
    - Ctrl+Space / Ctrl+Enter: Add focused node to selection.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Org Chart Selection" name="org-chart-selection" type="generated"/%}
